	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Show your upcoming calendar plans inside Larpy. Events stay on this device and never count as completed activities. Larpy does not edit existing events.</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Larpy reads completed workouts to automatically log Gym and movement. No heart rate, weight, or medical records are requested.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Larpy only reads workouts you choose to share for Body progress and does not save or change Health data.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dictate a proof note when you tap Say it instead. Audio is transcribed on this device and is not saved.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Turn your spoken activity note into editable text on this device. Review it before saving; voice alone does not verify Work or Body.</string>
	<key>UIFileSharingEnabled</key>
